menu "Device Server"
    config DEVICE_SERVER_AUTH_TOKEN
        string "Local HTTP bearer token (64 hexadecimal characters)"
        default ""
        help
            Generate a token with Python: import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32)).
            Keep it in local sdkconfig. An empty or invalid token disables the server.
            HTTP is unencrypted; use this service only on a trusted local network.
endmenu
